-19#:~:text=Beneath%20his%20gaze%2C%20his,to%20open%20his%20eyes.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e10","era":null,"summary":"Strefan notices the wrong eyes and loose skin and tears the false father open to reveal a half-formed, many-toothed creature.","participants":["strefan-maurer","hladvora"],"location":"strefan-s-family-manor","importance":"major","page":"stories/devouring-house-2021-11-19","order":771,"story_date":"2021-11-19","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":107,"quote":"Weeping, with all his strength, he tore his father open.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=Weeping%2C%20with%20all%20his,tore%20his%20father%20open.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Devouring House","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Brian Evenson"],"date":"2021-11-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=Weeping%2C%20with%20all%20his,tore%20his%20father%20open.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e11","era":null,"summary":"Strefan strangles the creature until it bursts into blood that vanishes into the floor, and the house disappears.","participants":["strefan-maurer","hladvora"],"location":"strefan-s-family-manor","importance":"major","page":"stories/devouring-house-2021-11-19","order":771,"story_date":"2021-11-19","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":117,"quote":"And then suddenly it burst into a torrent of blood within his hands.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=And%20then%20suddenly%20it,blood%20within%2